Package: yad
Version: @DEB_YAD_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/v1cont/yad
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0, libcairo2, libpango-1.0-0, libintl8
Description: GTK3 dialog utility for Xios scripts
 YAD displays GTK dialogs from shell scripts. This iOS build keeps the core
 GTK3 dialog, tools, icon browser and settings helper, while disabling optional
 WebKit, spell, GtkSourceView, AppIndicator and tray integrations.
